    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846660/extras/942972e3adfc6fc11f7e9dc1fb280121.poster.avif?t=1710393419\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846660/extras/942972e3adfc6fc11f7e9dc1fb280121.webm?t=1710393419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846660/extras/942972e3adfc6fc11f7e9dc1fb280121.mp4?t=1710393419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Our character finds himself in the midst of mysterious events when his new friend Molly, whom he has just met at a night play, disappears.<br><br>To reach Molly, he must collect various clues and find the treasure in the forest that Will mentioned. But there is something else waiting for him in the forest.<br><br>In this exploration and puzzle game, you will collect various clues, research in the library and try to solve a mystery with the information you have gathered.<br><br>In this game set in a cute town, earn money by selling the apples you collect from the apple orchard to the market. go after a treasure for more money.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846660/extras/151e791845a44319c3fd1fe6e455e680.poster.avif?t=1710393419\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846660/extras/151e791845a44319c3fd1fe6e455e680.webm?t=1710393419\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846660/extras/151e791845a44319c3fd1fe6e455e680.mp4?t=1710393419\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Create a formula needed to open the portal and enter a fantastic universe.<br><br>Research and learn how the formula is made and collect the necessary elements to open the portal.<br><br>Scare your friends in a halloween event.<br><br>Strange is a game with realistic graphics in an atmospheric environment. It tells a mysterious story based on a mission system in which we do various mischief through the eyes of a child, and you can spend an enjoyable 5 hours.",
